lary hikes: PM Modi to industry]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/we-cut-tax-but-where-are-the-hires-salary-hikes-pm-to-industry/articleshow/136007746.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136007746.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/we-cut-tax-but-where-are-the-hires-salary-hikes-pm-to-industry/articleshow/136007746.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/we-cut-tax-but-where-are-the-hires-salary-hikes-pm-to-industry/articleshow/136007746.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-20T04:43:35+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136007793,imgsize-48746.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Cyclone Akvan: Odisha braces for landfall; 3 lakh evacuated, CM Majhi holds midnight meet]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cyclone-akvan-odisha-braces-for-landfall-3-lakh-evacuated-cm-majhi-holds-midnight-meet/articleshow/136005443.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136005443.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Odisha has evacuated nearly 3 lakh residents and set up over 2,500 relief camps in response to Cyclone Akvan. The cyclone is expected to make landfall between Puri and Gopalpur with significant wind speeds. Rescue teams, including the National Disaster Response Force and Coast Guard, are ready to assist in vulnerable areas. Meanwhile, Andhra Pradesh is also preparing for the storm with designated alerts for various districts.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cyclone-akvan-odisha-braces-for-landfall-3-lakh-evacuated-cm-majhi-holds-midnight-meet/articleshow/136005443.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cyclone-akvan-odisha-braces-for-landfall-3-lakh-evacuated-cm-majhi-holds-midnight-meet/articleshow/136005443.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-20T04:00:40+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Trisha Mahajan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136005474,imgsize-263576.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[3 killed as minibus plunges into 100-foot gorge on Kodaikanal-Palani Ghat Road]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/3-killed-as-minibus-plunges-into-100-foot-gorge-on-kodaikanal-palani-ghat-road/articleshow/136005406.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136005406.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Three people were killed, and several others were injured after a minibus carrying 24 passengers plunged into a 100-foot-deep gorge near Savarikkadu on the Kodaikanal–Ghat Road in Dindigul district. The passengers were returning from a wedding function in Kodaikanal. Rescue teams rushed to the spot and shifted the injured to nearby hospitals.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/3-killed-as-minibus-plunges-into-100-foot-gorge-on-kodaikanal-palani-ghat-road/articleshow/136005406.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/3-killed-as-minibus-plunges-into-100-foot-gorge-on-kodaikanal-palani-ghat-road/articleshow/136005406.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-20T03:37:48+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136005405,imgsize-125903.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[SC: Assess buyer's liability before home loan recovery]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sc-assess-buyers-liability-before-home-loan-recovery/articleshow/136005296.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5