ls/articleshow/135998886.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135998886.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[In a significant move, the Centre has approved a stipend of Rs 30,070 for foreign medical graduates interning in India, effective November 16. This decision ensures equal pay for both foreign and Indian medical interns, adhering to the National Medical Commission's guidelines issued earlier this year. Several government medical institutions are set to adopt this stipend without delay, marking an important step in supporting foreign medical professionals.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/foreign-medical-graduates-to-get-rs-30000-monthly-stipend-at-five-central-hospitals/articleshow/135998886.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/foreign-medical-graduates-to-get-rs-30000-monthly-stipend-at-five-central-hospitals/articleshow/135998886.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T22:18:57+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Anuja Jaiswal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135999378,imgsize-184394.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Stop complaining, look inwards': Congress hits back after PM Modi pulls up India Inc over jobs, salaries]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/stop-complaining-look-inwards-congress-hits-back-after-pm-modi-pulls-up-india-inc-over-jobs-salaries/articleshow/135997732.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135997732.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/stop-complaining-look-inwards-congress-hits-back-after-pm-modi-pulls-up-india-inc-over-jobs-salaries/articleshow/135997732.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[ht